{"seq":2,"slug":"nx-workspace","title":"Nx 工作空间：项目图、受影响分析与 generators","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/nx-workspace","wordCount":1139,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"nx-工作空间-项目图-受影响分析与-generators\">Nx 工作空间：项目图、受影响分析与 generators</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Project Graph</td>\n<td>Nx 基于源码分析构建的项目间依赖关系图，包含静态导入和 package.json 声明的依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Affected</td>\n<td>基于 git diff 和项目图的反向遍历，计算最小需要重新执行任务的包集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Generator</td>\n<td>Nx 的代码生成工具，用于标准化包、组件、模块的创建方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Executor</td>\n<td>对构建/测试/lint 命令的标准化封装，在 project.json 的 targets 中配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Target</td>\n<td>project.json 中定义的可执行任务单元（如 build、test、lint）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tag</td>\n<td>为项目标记的分类标签，用于模块边界约束的 source/target 条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"nx-的定位与核心能力\">Nx 的定位与核心能力</h2><p>Nx 是一个功能完整的<strong>智能构建系统和 Monorepo 管理框架</strong>，由 Nrwl 团队维护，支持 JavaScript/TypeScript、Go、Rust、Java 等多语言场景。与 Turborepo 相比，Nx 提供了更丰富的工具链：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Project Graph</strong>：精确感知所有包之间的源码级依赖关系</li>\n<li><strong>Affected 分析</strong>：基于 git diff 计算最小受影响包集合</li>\n<li><strong>Generators</strong>：代码生成工具，标准化包和组件的创建方式</li>\n<li><strong>Executors</strong>：可配置的任务执行器，包装构建/测试/lint 命令</li>\n<li><strong>Plugins</strong>：官方和社区 Nx 插件，深度集成 Next.js、Vite、Jest、ESLint 等</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Nx 适合<strong>需要深度治理能力的中大型 Monorepo</strong>，或技术栈跨越多个框架的团队。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nx-工作空间初始化\">Nx 工作空间初始化</h2><h3 id=\"新建-nx-monorepo\">新建 Nx Monorepo</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建全新 Nx 工作空间（交互式选择预设）&#10;npx create-nx-workspace@latest my-org&#10;&#10;# 指定预设（integrated：Nx 完整管理；package-based：类 Turborepo 轻量模式）&#10;npx create-nx-workspace@latest my-org --preset=ts&#10;&#10;# 在已有 Monorepo 中初始化 Nx&#10;npx nx@latest init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建全新 Nx 工作空间（交互式选择预设）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create-nx-workspace@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-org</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 指定预设（integrated：Nx 完整管理；package-based：类 Turborepo 轻量模式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create-nx-workspace@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-org</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preset=ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在已有 Monorepo 中初始化 Nx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nx@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工作空间结构\">工作空间结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-org/&#10;├── apps/                    # 应用包&#10;│   └── web/&#10;│       ├── project.json     # Nx 项目配置（targets + tags）&#10;│       └── src/&#10;├── libs/                    # 共享库（Nx 默认用 libs 而非 packages）&#10;│   ├── ui/&#10;│   │   ├── project.json&#10;│   │   └── src/&#10;│   └── utils/&#10;│       ├── project.json&#10;│       └── src/&#10;├── nx.json                  # Nx 全局配置&#10;└── package.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-org/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/                    # 应用包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── web/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── project.json     # Nx 项目配置（targets + tags）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── libs/                    # 共享库（Nx 默认用 libs 而非 packages）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ui/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── project.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── utils/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── project.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── nx.json                  # Nx 全局配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── package.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nx-json-核心配置\">nx.json 核心配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;defaultBase&quot;: &quot;main&quot;,&#10;  &quot;targetDefaults&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;production&quot;, &quot;^production&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;, &quot;^production&quot;, &quot;{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;, &quot;{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;namedInputs&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;default&quot;: [&quot;{projectRoot}/**/*&quot;, &quot;sharedGlobals&quot;],&#10;    &quot;production&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;, &quot;!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)&quot;, &quot;!{projectRoot}/*.md&quot;],&#10;    &quot;sharedGlobals&quot;: [&quot;{workspaceRoot}/babel.config.json&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;nxCloudId&quot;: &quot;your-nx-cloud-id&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"defaultBase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"targetDefaults\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"namedInputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{projectRoot}/**/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sharedGlobals\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!{projectRoot}/*.md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sharedGlobals\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{workspaceRoot}/babel.config.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"nxCloudId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"your-nx-cloud-id\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>namedInputs</code> 是 Nx 的命名输入集，可在各 target 中复用。<code>production</code> 排除了测试文件和 README，使这些文件变更不触发 build 缓存失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"project-graph-深度解析\">Project Graph 深度解析</h2><p>Nx 的 Project Graph 是其核心竞争力，能准确捕捉<strong>源码级别的依赖关系</strong>（而非仅依赖 <code>package.json</code> 声明）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"依赖关系的识别来源\">依赖关系的识别来源</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Nx 项目图引擎] --&gt; B[package.json dependencies]&#10;    A --&gt; C[TypeScript import 静态分析]&#10;    A --&gt; D[自定义 project.json 依赖声明]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Nx 插件(如 @nx/js 的 JSX 分析)]&#10;    B --&gt; F[项目图节点与边]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[Nx 项目图引擎] --&gt; B[package.json dependencies]\n    A --&gt; C[TypeScript import 静态分析]\n    A --&gt; D[自定义 project.json 依赖声明]\n    A --&gt; E[Nx 插件(如 @nx/js 的 JSX 分析)]\n    B --&gt; F[项目图节点与边]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><p>这意味着即使包 A 通过动态 <code>require</code> 引用了包 B，但未在 <code>package.json</code> 中声明，Nx 也能通过 TypeScript 静态分析捕获这个隐式依赖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查看和使用项目图\">查看和使用项目图</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在浏览器中打开交互式项目图&#10;nx graph&#10;&#10;# 聚焦查看某个项目的依赖子图&#10;nx graph --focus=web&#10;&#10;# 过滤只显示受 utils 影响的项目&#10;nx graph --affected&#10;&#10;# 导出项目图为 JSON&#10;nx graph --file=project-graph.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在浏览器中打开交互式项目图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 聚焦查看某个项目的依赖子图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --focus=web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤只显示受 utils 影响的项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --affected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 导出项目图为 JSON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --file=project-graph.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>交互式项目图支持：点击节点展开/收起、过滤特定类型的依赖、查看任务执行顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"affected-受影响分析\">Affected 受影响分析</h2><p><code>nx affected</code> 命令基于 git diff 计算最小需要重新处理的包集合，是 Nx 在 CI 场景下节省时间的核心机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. nx affected 读取 git diff（默认对比 defaultBase = &#39;main&#39;）&#10;2. 找出有文件变更的所有项目（直接受影响项目）&#10;3. 通过项目图的反向遍历，找出所有依赖这些项目的项目（间接受影响项目）&#10;4. 返回上述项目的并集\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. nx affected 读取 git diff（默认对比 defaultBase = 'main'）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 找出有文件变更的所有项目（直接受影响项目）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 通过项目图的反向遍历，找出所有依赖这些项目的项目（间接受影响项目）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 返回上述项目的并集</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    utils[&quot;packages/utils (变更)&quot;] --&gt; ui[&quot;packages/ui (受影响)&quot;]&#10;    utils --&gt; hooks[&quot;packages/hooks (受影响)&quot;]&#10;    ui --&gt; web[&quot;apps/web (受影响)&quot;]&#10;    hooks --&gt; web&#10;    ui --&gt; mobile[&quot;apps/mobile (受影响)&quot;]&#10;    config[&quot;tooling/config (未变更)&quot;] -.-&gt; utils\">graph LR\n    utils[\"packages/utils (变更)\"] --&gt; ui[\"packages/ui (受影响)\"]\n    utils --&gt; hooks[\"packages/hooks (受影响)\"]\n    ui --&gt; web[\"apps/web (受影响)\"]\n    hooks --&gt; web\n    ui --&gt; mobile[\"apps/mobile (受影响)\"]\n    config[\"tooling/config (未变更)\"] -.-&gt; utils</pre><p>若只有 <code>packages/utils</code> 发生变更，<code>nx affected</code> 会返回：utils + ui + hooks + web + mobile，而不包含 config（虽然 utils 依赖 config，但 config 没有变更）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"affected-命令用法\">Affected 命令用法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看受影响的项目列表&#10;nx affected:graph&#10;&#10;# 对受影响项目运行 build&#10;nx affected -t build&#10;&#10;# 对受影响项目运行多个任务&#10;nx affected -t build test lint&#10;&#10;# 指定对比 base（CI 场景常用）&#10;nx affected -t build --base=origin/main --head=HEAD&#10;&#10;# PR 场景：对比目标分支&#10;nx affected -t build --base=${{ github.base_ref }} --head=HEAD\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看受影响的项目列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected:graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对受影响项目运行 build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对受影响项目运行多个任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 指定对比 base（CI 场景常用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base=origin/main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --head=HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># PR 场景：对比目标分支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base=${{ </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">github</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">base_ref</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} --head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HEAD</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ci-集成策略\">CI 集成策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions&#10;- name: Run affected tests&#10;  run: nx affected -t test --base=origin/${{ github.base_ref }} --head=HEAD --parallel=3&#10;  env:&#10;    NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run affected tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nx affected -t test --base=origin/${{ github.base_ref }} --head=HEAD --parallel=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--parallel=N</code> 指定最大并行任务数，推荐设置为 CI 机器 CPU 核心数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"generators-代码生成\">Generators 代码生成</h2><p>Generators 是 Nx 的代码生成工具，用于标准化新包、组件、模块的创建方式，减少手动复制粘贴导致的不一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用官方-generator\">使用官方 generator</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成一个新的 React 库&#10;nx g @nx/react:lib feature-auth --directory=libs/feature-auth&#10;&#10;# 生成一个 Next.js 应用&#10;nx g @nx/next:app dashboard --directory=apps/dashboard&#10;&#10;# 生成一个 React 组件&#10;nx g @nx/react:component button --project=ui\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成一个新的 React 库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @nx/react:lib</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature-auth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --directory=libs/feature-auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成一个 Next.js 应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @nx/next:app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dashboard</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --directory=apps/dashboard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成一个 React 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @nx/react:component</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> button</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --project=ui</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义-generator\">自定义 Generator</h3><p>创建自定义 generator 来标准化团队的包创建规范：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在工作空间内创建 generator&#10;nx g @nx/plugin:generator create-feature-lib --project=tools\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在工作空间内创建 generator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @nx/plugin:generator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create-feature-lib</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --project=tools</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Generator 的核心文件结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"tools/src/generators/create-feature-lib/&#10;├── index.ts           # generator 主逻辑&#10;├── schema.json        # 参数 schema（生成 CLI 选项）&#10;└── files/             # 模板文件（EJS 语法）&#10;    ├── src/&#10;    │   └── index.ts__tmpl__&#10;    └── package.json__tmpl__\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tools/src/generators/create-feature-lib/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── index.ts           # generator 主逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── schema.json        # 参数 schema（生成 CLI 选项）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── files/             # 模板文件（EJS 语法）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── index.ts__tmpl__</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── package.json__tmpl__</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// tools/src/generators/create-feature-lib/index.ts&#10;import { Tree, formatFiles, generateFiles, names } from &#39;@nx/devkit&#39;;&#10;import * as path from &#39;path&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface CreateFeatureLibSchema {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  directory: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export async function createFeatureLibGenerator(tree: Tree, options: CreateFeatureLibSchema) {&#10;  const { name, className, propertyName } = names(options.name);&#10;&#10;  generateFiles(tree, path.join(__dirname, &#39;files&#39;), options.directory, {&#10;    name,&#10;    className,&#10;    propertyName,&#10;    template: &#39;&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  await formatFiles(tree);&#10;}&#10;&#10;export default createFeatureLibGenerator;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tools/src/generators/create-feature-lib/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Tree, formatFiles, generateFiles, names } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@nx/devkit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateFeatureLibSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  directory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createFeatureLibGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateFeatureLibSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8